This directory holds Territorium's brand identity: its name, emblem, logos
and original audio. None of these assets come from OpenFront; the
OpenFront proprietary assets that shipped upstream were removed and are
not part of this repository.

The source code of Territorium is licensed under the GNU AGPL v3 (see
/LICENSE). That license covers code only. It grants NO rights to the
assets below, nor to the Territorium name.

1. ASSETS - ALL RIGHTS RESERVED (images/, sounds/, public/)
   Every file in images/, sounds/ and public/, including files added
   later, among them:
   - images/Favicon.svg, images/TerritoriumEmblem.svg,
     images/TerritoriumLogo.svg,
     images/TerritoriumLogoLight.svg, images/Territorium.png,
     images/TerritoriumMark.png: the Territorium emblem and logos
   - images/MIRVIcon.svg, images/EmpIconWhite.svg,
     images/RadarIconWhite.svg, images/WhiteFlagIconWhite.svg,
     images/MedalIcon.svg, images/EmeraldIcon.svg: original game icons
   - public/cosmetics/crowns/*, public/cosmetics/flags/*: the cosmetics
     sold in the Territorium store
   - sounds/music/menu-theme.mp3, sounds/music/gameplay.mp3,
     sounds/effects/game-start-alert.mp3, sounds/effects/emp-hit.wav,
     sounds/effects/radar-ping.wav: original audio

   You may run, build and test the official Territorium software
   containing these assets. You may NOT copy, modify, redistribute or
   extract them, or use them in any other project, product or service,
   without prior written permission.

2. NAME AND TRADEMARK
   "Territorium" and the Territorium emblem and logos identify the
   official game published by Broussen Studio. You may NOT use them, or any
   confusingly similar name or logo, to name, brand, advertise or
   promote a fork, a modified version or any other product or service,
   and you may not imply endorsement by Territorium.

   Forks are welcome under the AGPL, but they must remove this directory,
   ship their own assets and use their own name. Factual references
   ("based on Territorium") are allowed.

